28802	1	1079	1	Paul, an apostle of Christ Jesus by the will of God, and Timothy our brother,\nTo the church of God in Corinth, together with all his holy people throughout Achaia:
28803	1	1079	2	Grace and peace to you from God our Father and the Lord Jesus Christ.
