29811	1	1126	1	Paul, an apostle of Christ Jesus by the will of God, in keeping with the promise of life that is in Christ Jesus,
29812	1	1126	2	To Timothy, my dear son:\nGrace, mercy and peace from God the Father and Christ Jesus our Lord.
