30557	1	1161	6	Whoever claims to live in him must live as Jesus did.
30558	1	1161	7	Dear friends, I am not writing you a new command but an old one, which you have had since the beginning. This old command is the message you have heard.
30559	1	1161	8	Yet I am writing you a new command; its truth is seen in him and in you, because the darkness is passing and the true light is already shining.
30560	1	1161	9	Anyone who claims to be in the light but hates a brother or sister is still in the darkness.
30561	1	1161	10	Anyone who loves their brother and sister lives in the light, and there is nothing in them to make them stumble.
30562	1	1161	11	But anyone who hates a brother or sister is in the darkness and walks around in the darkness. They do not know where they are going, because the darkness has blinded them.
