30675	1	1167	1	Jude, a servant of Jesus Christ and a brother of James,\nTo those who have been called, who are loved in God the Father and kept for Jesus Christ:
30676	1	1167	2	Mercy, peace and love be yours in abundance.
30677	1	1167	3	Dear friends, although I was very eager to write to you about the salvation we share, I felt compelled to write and urge you to contend for the faith that was once for all entrusted to God’s holy people.
