43391	2	415	4	The king asked, “Well, how can I help you?”\nWith a prayer to the God of heaven,
43392	2	415	5	I replied, “If it please the king, and if you are pleased with me, your servant, send me to Judah to rebuild the city where my ancestors are buried.”
43393	2	415	6	The king, with the queen sitting beside him, asked, “How long will you be gone? When will you return?” After I told him how long I would be gone, the king agreed to my request.
